    {
      "id": 2,
      "primary_message": "Preheat a Belgian waffle iron according to manufacturer's instructions and prepare with nonstick cooking spray. Spread 1/5 of stuffing mixture across the surface of the waffle iron. Cook until crisp on both sides, about 10 minutes total.",
